OL,3,GNEWSADriver on phone killed gran in
OL,4,AChristmas Day crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding driver who killed a
OL,7,Fgrandmother on her way home from her
OL,8,Ffamily's Christmas Day in a crash while
OL,9,Fhe was using his phone has been jailed
OL,10,Ffor nine years.
OL,12,FJudith Dunn, 80, had just thanked her
OL,13,Fdaughter for a lovely day when her and
OL,14,Fher husband's car was ploughed into by
OL,15,FJoshua Jones, 30, on the A1(M) near
OL,16,FDarlington on 25 December 2024,
OL,17,FTeesside Crown Court heard.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
