OL,3,GNEWSADriver on phone killed gran in
OL,4,AChristmas Day crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FMr Dunn, who was seriously injured,
OL,7,Fsaid "an act [tantamount] to murder
OL,8,Fwith a motor vehicle" had robbed him of
OL,9,Fhis "constant companion" of more than
OL,10,F60 years.
OL,12,FJones, from Catterick Garrison,
OL,13,Fadmitted causing death and serious
OL,14,Finjury by dangerous driving. He was
OL,15,Fcaught speeding again months after the
OL,16,Fcrash.
